    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>University student Margaret Moy fled to Detroit to escape her abusive father, only to be seized off the street by a @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} Gargoyle looking for war-party fodder; her sire abandoned her the moment she rose from the ground in uncontrollable rage. She made her way back to Montreal, where Ezekiel found her, guided her through the Creation Rites, and welcomed her into 25:17 as &quot;Erinyi.&quot; Torn between love for her savior Ezekiel and consuming rage, she cycled through the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.exke2riW9D0htoUu]{Path of Cathari} before Ezekiel had Reza Fatir guide her onto the more structured @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.MkHKLOcOCLQ5pWCj]{Path of Honorable Accord}. She now travels with the nomadic Navigators, having joined the band Wyldchylde alongside C\u00e9l\u00e8ste, though pack priest Miguel Santo Domingo remains wary of her lingering ties to Ezekiel.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Quick to anger; it takes real effort not to rip annoying Malkavians apart. You find release in battle and music, but nothing compares to the love in your dead heart.</p><h2>Secrets</h2><p>Erinyi believes Ezekiel is not a pawn of any grand conspiracy but a strong, conscientious leader who could save Montreal.</p>",
    "notes": "Embraced 1994. Apparent age: early 20s. Over seven feet tall on gargoyle legs with eight-inch horns and gray wings. Merits/Flaws: Short Fuse. @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.MkHKLOcOCLQ5pWCj]{Path of Honorable Accord} 5. Disciplines (as printed): Fortitude 2, Potence 2, Visceratika 3.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
